{'symbol': 'CSX', 'date': '2022-04-19 19:57:00', 'title': 'CSX ANNOUNCES ADVANCES ON FUTURE WAGE ADJUSTMENTS FOR UNIONIZED OPERATIONS EMPLOYEES', 'text': 'JACKSONVILLE, FLA., APRIL 19, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- CSX CORP. (NASDAQ: CSX) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS REACHED A TENTATIVE AGREEMENT WITH THE SHEET METAL, AIR, RAIL AND TRANSPORTATION WORKERS, TRANSPORTATION DIVISION (SMART-TD) TO PROVIDE SMART-TD TRAINMEN AND YARDMASTERS WITH MONTHLY ADVANCE PAYMENTS ON FUTURE WAGE ADJUSTMENTS ANTICIPATED IN SETTLEMENT OF THE 2020 ROUND OF NATIONAL BARGAINING BETWEEN RAIL LABOR AND THE CLASS I RAILROADS. CSX ALSO NOTIFIED ITS OTHER LABOR ORGANIZATION REPRESENTATIVES THAT IT INTENDS TO REACH AGREEMENTS TO PROVIDE IDENTICAL PAYMENTS TO ALL UNIONIZED EMPLOYEES.'}